// tool/alm_tension_field_bridge.hexa — N-51 ALM Tension-Field Closed-Loop Bridge
//
// PURPOSE
//   N-51 EXEC track: build the bridge socket between anima-core mind.tension
//   dynamics and Mistral-7B-v0.3 + r14 LoRA inference, then run a 100-step
//   closed-loop with mandatory random-control branch to test whether the RED
//   verdict on the 14-gate L1 (static measurement) flips under live operational
//   dynamics.
//
//   Per docs/strategic_alm_tension_field_test_2026_05_01.md §5 protocol.
//
// COMPONENTS (all in this single file for orchestration locality)
//   1. EMIT     — gate_signal trajectory state serialization
//                 (~120 LOC tension-field state → JSON)
//   2. POD      — pod-side .py launcher + ssh / scp / health-check
//                 (~80 LOC pod orchestration; .py file already pre-staged)
//   3. READBACK — pod inference output → hidden-state extract → 14-gate L1
//                 / phi* / V_phen recompute (~150 LOC parser/aggregator)
//   4. ORCHESTR — 100-step loop driver, random-control branch, ledger emit
//                 (~100 LOC verdict computation + race-isolation guard)
//
// RAW POLICY
//   raw#9   pod-side .py allowed under HEXA-FIRST exemption
//           (file: /tmp/n51_alm_tension_inject.py — emitted to /workspace/n51_tension/ on pod)
//   raw#10  no overclaim — measurement-artifact disclosed via mandatory random-control
//   raw#12  falsifier predicates pre-registered HERE in §5 below before any run
//   raw#15  no-hardcode — paths in constants block
//
// USAGE
//   hexa tool/alm_tension_field_bridge.hexa stage      // copy .py + prompts + phi_templates to pod
//   hexa tool/alm_tension_field_bridge.hexa run        // execute the closed-loop on pod
//   hexa tool/alm_tension_field_bridge.hexa fetch      // pull ledger + render verdict
//   hexa tool/alm_tension_field_bridge.hexa all        // stage + run + fetch
//
// INPUTS
//   state/phi_vec_extraction_result.json    (16 phi templates, 16-D each)
//   /tmp/n51_alm_tension_inject.py           (pod-side driver, pre-staged in /tmp)
//
// OUTPUTS
//   state/strategic_alm_tension_field_exec_2026_05_01/closed_loop_ledger.json
//   state/strategic_alm_tension_field_exec_2026_05_01/verdict.json
//   state/strategic_alm_tension_field_exec_2026_05_01/orchestrator_log.json
//   docs/strategic_alm_tension_field_exec_results_2026_05_01.md   (markdown report)

